1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,900
A secret number hides in the range...

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,360
can you crack it?

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,800
This is Number Detective!

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:14,420
Guess a number — too high or too low, the clues point the way!

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,520
Guess ten...

6
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:20,460
too low, arrow up!

7
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:22,980
Guess sixteen...

8
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:26,660
too high, arrow down!

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,240
Guess fourteen...

10
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:32,800
that's it — case cracked!

11
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:38,980
Narrow the range with every clue — how few guesses can you crack it in?

12
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:46,180
Parents — this builds number sense and logical thinking, one clue at a time!

13
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:53,740
Find it in the app — tap Math Game Zone, pick Number Detective, choose your level, and play!

14
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:58,400
Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
